{"id":"646177","name":"莲藕红枣汤圆","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/646177/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"三全汤圆","amount":"12个"},{"name":"莲藕","amount":"6块"}],"sub":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"6颗"},{"name":"桂圆","amount":"6颗"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"三全汤圆备用。","img":"images/646177/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"莲藕洗净，削皮，切片，备用。","img":"images/646177/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红枣，洗净，备用。","img":"images/646177/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"桂圆洗净，去壳，备用。","img":"images/646177/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中倒入适量水，放入莲藕、红枣和桂圆。","img":"images/646177/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火烧开，转中小火煮十分钟左右。","img":"images/646177/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入汤圆煮10分钟，用勺子搅一下，防止粘锅。","img":"images/646177/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"已煮好。","img":"images/646177/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盛入碗中。","img":"images/646177/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"甜香可口。","img":"images/646177/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}